WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.360
The president will not find lawlessness or violence here.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:09.320
I have been so deeply disappointed to see footage from a half decade ago recycled and

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:11.280
recycled again.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:16.360
If President Trump came to Portland today, what he would find are people riding their

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:23.320
bikes, playing sports, enjoying the sunshine, buying produce at a farmer's market.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.639
People enjoy sunshine and buy produce at farmer's markets in Ukraine.

00:00:26.639 --> 00:00:29.080
Is Ukraine A-OK?

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.600
And recycled footage?

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.400
There's been riots for over 100 days.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:38.480
They showed footage of January 6th for two years, and that was only one day.

